e main character, but is actually a good friend to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is feared because she belongs to the horned tribes (a certain tribe supposedly eats humans),"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"she nevertheless takes pride in bearing a horn."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suddenly disappears throughout the second half of the game when it's not her route."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It is revealed in her route that she came to the school in search of a certain someone, and that the absence at a certain point of the story is due to her running out of time when continuing to attend school."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Dating back to her early childhood when she left her village playing in the forest, she meets a certain boy."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She got hurt while playing with him, so he carries her back and is rewarded with a kiss."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Unbeknownst to her at that time, she accidentally shared her magic through that action, and will inevitably die within a few months after the start of the story if she does not find the boy and retrieves her magic from him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27110"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68a6d43b6daff1d3831c93c4832bee18d924745ae4486f6f6708deb399d60fb1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/6107b210ad2d71f58ef896b832d03f35e28983bb24aec90f160d8dfe2a50cf36.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷青","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"横手 久美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18953","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c27111","characterName":"ミルキー・ミルコック","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c27111"},"originalCharacterName":"ミルキー・ミルコック","characterNameS